# This repository is the engine workspace and its specifications.
# Everything else in this home directory belongs to other projects and is not part of it.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/rust-toolchain.toml
!/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
# The written quality bar and its exception table (EXC-001) must travel with the code: an ADR
# that points at an exception nobody else can see is not a record.
!/CONSTRAINTS.md
!/LICENSE-MIT
!/LICENSE-APACHE
!/crates/
!/bins/
!/scripts/
# Only the engine's own script is part of the repository; this home directory has others.
/scripts/*
!/scripts/parity-tokenize.sh
!/specs/
# Design notes for the engine itself live beside the specs. Only this directory is part of the
# repository; the other trees under docs/ (graph dumps, scratch notes) are not.
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/design/
/docs/design/*
!/docs/design/*.md
# The measurement record travels with the code: a claim in a comment or an ADR points at these
# numbers, and a number that only exists on one machine's disk cannot be checked by anyone else.
!/docs/benchmarks.md
!/docs/benchmarks/
/docs/benchmarks/*
!/docs/benchmarks/*.md

# Build output is large and reproducible. The pattern is not anchored so the
# out-of-workspace prototype under crates/ does not drag its own target/ in.
target/
